148
00:33:35,203 --> 00:33:43,203
嗚呼 知ってる 知ってる 使い倒された言葉使ってみたって あの人の様にはなれないのです
Ah, I know, I know, even if I try using worn-out words, I can never become like that person.

149
00:33:44,103 --> 00:33:52,103
戯れ言も 至極真っ当さ 然れど痛い日々だ
Even idle chatter seems completely sensible. Yet these are painful days.

150
00:33:52,953 --> 00:33:59,353
所詮僕は偽物さ 壊れる前に壊してしまう前に
After all, I'm just a fake. Before I break down, before I destroy everything...

151
