辿り着いた
Have finally reached this place.

163
00:35:22,409 --> 00:35:26,589
目覚めた心は走り出した
My awakened heart started running,

164
00:35:26,809 --> 00:35:30,989
未来を願うため
To wish for the future.

165
00:35:31,189 --> 00:35:35,389
難しい道で立ち止まっても
Even if I stop on a difficult path,

166
00:35:35,609 --> 00:35:39,989
それはきれいだ
That's alright,

167
00:35:40,189 --> 00:35:43,989
押されていつも待っててくれるから怖くない
Because you're always pushing me and waiting for me, I'm not afraid.

168
00:35:44,189 --> 00:35:48,589
どんな何があっても挫けない
No matter what happens, I won't give up.

169
00:35:52,389 --> 00:35:53,289
くそが
Damn it!

170
00:36:19,389 --> 00:36:22,669
交わした約束忘れないよ
The promise we exchanged, I won't forget,

171
00:36:19,389 --> 00:36:33,602
[Title: コネクト]
[Title: Connect]

172
00:36:23,009 --> 00:36:25,949
目を閉じ確かめる
I close my eyes and confirm it as

173
