何度でも裂いてこの世界歩んでこう
I'll tear through it again and again and walk through this world!

178
00:37:03,989 --> 00:37:08,789
とめどなく刻まれた
Unstoppably etched into me,

179
00:37:09,189 --> 00:37:14,689
時は今始まり告げ変わらない思いをのせ
Time now proclaims the beginning, carrying unchanging feelings.

180
00:37:14,989 --> 00:37:19,989
閉ざされた扉開けよう
Let's open the closed door!

181
00:37:23,189 --> 00:37:30,189
目覚めた心は走り出した未来を描くため
My awakened heart started running to paint the future,

182
00:37:30,389 --> 00:37:35,189
難しい道で立ち止まっても空はきれいな青さでいつも待っててくれる
Even if I stop on a difficult path, the sky is always waiting with its clear blue,

183
00:37:35,489 --> 00:37:42,689
だから怖くないもう何があっても挫けない
So I'm not afraid. No matter what happens, I won't give up.

184
00:37:43,189 --> 00:37:48,989
もう何があっても挫けない
No matter what happens, I won't give up.

185
