喜びも悲しみもわけあえば強まる思いこの声が届くなら
If we share both joy and sorrow, our feelings grow stronger—if this voice can reach you,

188
00:38:31,189 --> 00:38:36,689
きっと奇跡はおこせるだろう
Surely we can work a miracle.

189
00:38:41,189 --> 00:38:44,189
交わした約束忘れないよ
The promise we exchanged, I won't forget,

190
00:38:44,489 --> 00:38:47,689
目を閉じ確かめる押し寄せた闇
I close my eyes and confirm the surging darkness

191
00:38:47,989 --> 00:38:52,689
振り払って進むよ
Swept aside as we press forward!

192
00:38:53,189 --> 00:39:00,189
どんなに大きな壁があっても超えてみせるからきっと
No matter how big the wall in our way may be, I'll surely push past it...

193
00:39:00,689 --> 00:39:05,189
明日信じて祈って
Believing in tomorrow, praying for it,

194
00:39:37,689 --> 00:39:43,189
壊れた世界で彷徨って私は
Wandering through a broken world, I,

195
00:39:43,489 --> 00:39:48,989
引き寄せられるように辿り着いた
