00:42:17,324 --> 00:42:21,924
Cry もう落下してないで 鈍った身体さらば 踊れよ
Cry, stop falling already, farewell to your sluggish body, dance!

211
00:42:22,324 --> 00:42:27,724
視界外 目逸らさないで 今はただ 離れてかないで
Don't look away from out of sight, for now just don't leave me!

